{"screen_name": "ryousangataK", "file": "ryousangataK", "name": "K3rd", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1774193465649516544/18KxvgNi.jpg", "header_url": "", "description": "けーさーど と読みます。イラストのお仕事募集しております。\nメール⇒k3rdnoryosangata★http://gmail.com(★→＠)\nskeb⇒http://skeb.jp/@ryousangataK\nFANBOX⇒http://k3rd.fanbox.cc\nイラストの転載、AIでの使用は禁止です", "total_works": 77, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2025-10-18T04:38:34.579465+00:00", "last_updated": "2025-10-18T04:38:34.579465+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 15000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-18T12:38:34.579465"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 15000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 15000, "max": 15000}}, "links": [{"label": "Website", "url": "https://k3rd.fanbox.cc", "name": ""}], "flags": {"from_archive": true}, "works": [{"path": "/@ryousangataK/works/78", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/46493a0a/uploads/origins/a797fcf9-dd58-4d65-a541-fc6486bb35ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e264f4dfc2ab6ebc11773416fcb0d291", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "K3rdさん、こんにちは！ \n またお世話になります！ \n\n もう一度私のオリジナルキャラクターのエマちゃんを描いて頂きたいです \n 一応エマちゃんの参考材料のURLをまた下に張っておきました！ \n\n 今回も詳細などお任せします！ \n\n ありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://x.com/kazakuri/status/1397562595662512130", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ryousangataK/works/77", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/41aab1ca/uploads/origins/4c5182f8-703b-475c-968f-b454b57615b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a829d8980fb2e64a3f2dde2e12171f98", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ryousangataK/works/76", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/610121b5/uploads/origins/ffe2cd10-b510-4ca4-8453-0825eb1dc5f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&t